          <msContents>
            <summary>Practica et accurtaciones Georgii Ryplay et Raimundi.</summary>
            <textLang mainLang="la" source="IANA">Latin</textLang>
            <msItem n="1" xml:id="MS_239_1">
              <author key="person_39386049">Dee, John (1527-1608)</author>
              <title type="original">Practica et accurtaciones Georgii Ryplay et Raimundi</title>
              <title type="standard"/>
              <textLang mainLang="la" source="IANA">Latin</textLang>
              <textLang mainLang="en" source="IANA">English</textLang>
              <filiation>The manuscript is listed as DM90 (under manuscripts 'known to have formed part of Dee's library but not [appearing] in his catalogue or lists') in 'John Dee's Library Catalogue', ed. by Julian Roberts and Andrew G. Watson (London: Bibliographical Society, 1990), p. 172.</filiation>
            </msItem>
          </msContents>
          <physDesc>
            <objectDesc form="codex">
              <supportDesc material="perg">
                <extent>1 bl. l. + 67 pp. (last 3 ll. bl.). 4to.
                  <dimensions type="leaf" unit="cm">
                    <dim type="width">15 cm</dim>
                    <dim type="length">20.5 cm</dim>
                  </dimensions>
                </extent>
                <foliation/><collation/>
